    "title": "Comment period extended for concrete plant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "12 hours ago RAYWOOD –– A recent deadline for comments about a concrete plant on Liberty County’s east side has been extended until Sept. 11, according to state Rep. Janis Holt. The announcement was made via the Republican legislators’ campaign page on Aug. 17. The original deadline for registering comments with state regulators was July 27. Read full article",
